ligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 4 \\\\ 4 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}8 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 4\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(1-16)i-(-4-24)j+(32+12)k \\\\  & =-15i+28j+44k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-1399" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3a4d9f8db3082c207ca11e72800d17f68c2553d620fd2016dbb87908834d587f"} {"question" "q-1399" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-1399" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-15i+28j+44k"] ["math" "-15i+44j-28k"] ["math" "-15i-28j+32k"] ["math" "15i+28j+44k"] ["math" "16i-28j+32k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-1399" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-15i+28j+44k"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨4,x,3⟩,$ $b=⟨-2,3,0⟩$ and $|\\,a\\times b\\,|=\\sqrt{181}.$ Find $x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & x & 3 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}x & 3 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & x \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0-9)i-(0+6)j+(12+2x)k \\\\  & =⟨-9,-6,12+2x⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{(-9)^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(12+2x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{81+36+144+48x+4{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{261+48x+4{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{181} \\\\ \\sqrt{261+48x+4{x}^{2}} & =\\sqrt{181} \\\\ 261+48x+4{x}^{2} & =181 \\\\ 4{x}^{2}+48x+80 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+12x+20 & =0 \\\\ (x+10)(x+2) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=-10,\\,-2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3a4d9f8db3082c207ca11e72800d17f68c2553d620fd2016dbb87908834d587f"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=-10,\\,-2"] ["math" "x=-4,\\,5"] ["math" "x=-5,\\,4"] ["math" "x=4,\\,10"] ["math" "x=\\pm 2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103547" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x=-10,\\,-2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨0,-2,3⟩,$ $b=⟨-2,1,-2x⟩$ and $|\\,a\\times b\\,|=\\sqrt{53}.$ Find $x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2x\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -2x\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4x-3)i-(0+6)j+(0-4)k \\\\  & =⟨4x-3,-6,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{(4x-3)^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+9+36+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+61}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{53} \\\\ \\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+61} & =\\sqrt{53} \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-24x+61 & =53 \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-24x+8 & =0 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-3x+1 & =0 \\\\ (2x-1)(x-1) & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2},\\,1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3a4d9f8db3082c207ca11e72800d17f68c2553d620fd2016dbb87908834d587f"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=-1,\\,2"] ["math" "x=-2"] ["math" "x=1"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-275275" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $u=⟨6,-2,0⟩$ and $v=⟨5,0,-3⟩.$ Find $u\\times v.$\n\n$u\\times v=⟨${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}$⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-275275" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 6 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}6 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot (-3)-0\\cdot 0)i-(6\\cdot (-3)-0\\cdot 5)j+(6\\cdot 0-(-2)\\cdot 5)k \\\\  & =(6-0)i-(-18-0)j+(0-(-10))k \\\\  & =6i+18j+10k \\\\  & =⟨6,18,10⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-275275" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3a4d9f8db3082c207ca11e72800d17f68c2553d620fd2016dbb87908834d587f"} {"question" "q-275275" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-275275" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed