ed}|i-|\\begin{aligned}x & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2-0)i-(2x-2)j+(0-1)k \\\\  & =⟨2,2-2x,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(2-2x)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+(4{x}^{2}-8x+4)+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-8x+9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{5} \\\\ \\sqrt{4{x}^{2}-8x+9} & =\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-8x+9 & =5 \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-8x+4 & =0 \\\\ (2x-2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ 2x-2 & =0 \\\\ x & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-282270" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "3a4d9f8db3082c207ca11e72800d17f68c2553d620fd2016dbb87908834d587f"} {"question" "q-282270" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"} {"question" "q-282270" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042483/state.json" "file_sha256" "c099c3d17e4e565137c01ed9372e63711406531e18779a049603d73c96782744"}] "usage" {"q-282270" []} "basis" 1547 "retractions" [] "immutable_answers" [17592186304178] "immutable_fields" [[17592186304177 :answer-fie